# COMPLETE SDM MODEL FITTING & PROJECTION WORKFLOW (FINAL)
# WITH ENHANCED PDP USING data_pdp() & UNCERTAINTY
# ADDED: Uncertainty analysis with sdm_uncertainty (nsim = 250, iteration = 250)
# INCLUDES: Both Mean and Median Uncertainty metrics
# SEQUENTIAL PROCESSING: Each species completes ALL scenarios before next species
# ============================================================================
#
# REQUIRED TUNING GRIDS (UPDATED FROM REFERENCE):
# - RF:  mtry = 1..n_predictors; ntree = c(400, 600, 800, 1000)
# - SVM: C = seq(2, 60, 5); sigma = seq(0.001, 0.3, 0.01)
# - MAX: regmult = seq(0.1, 2, 0.5); classes = (lq, lqh, lqhp, lqhpt)
# - NNM: size = 2..n_predictors; decay = c(seq(0.01, 1, 0.05), 1, 3, 4, 5, 6)
# - GBM: n.trees = seq(150, 200, 10); shrinkage = seq(1, 1.5, 0.2); n.minobsinnode = seq(1, 15, 2)
# - GLM: poly = 2
# - GAM: k = adaptive based on training data
# - GAU: only if n_pres >= 15
#
# Author: Data Analysis
# Date: 2026-03-15
################################################################################

